      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "> if you will not get rid of this update at least give us the option to have a pre 2026.3.1 legacy/accessibility option for us\n\nOn Windows (Steam), for now you can download the previous VRChat 2026.2.3p3 `Build 1867` and use it (for now). From the Steam Console (`steam://nav/console`), `download_depot 438100 438101 905545213110036892` will download that.\n\nIt won't be a functional option forever, because the server enforces a minimum version number to login/connect. Last I checked on July 31, 2026 the minimum build version required by the server was `Build 1865`.",
