  "details": "the new menu and ui has too many issues, including but not limited to extreme visual clutter, poor information density and layout, the new ui is horrible and is unreadable\n\nthe pre august menu and ui wasn't the best overall but it was easy to read enough to read while visually impaired and is better than what was given to us as of Aug 12th\n\nif you will not get rid of this update at least give us the option to have a pre 2026.3.1 legacy/accessibility option for us",
